     s0=(0.724258 + 176.702461j)  |f(s0)|=4.708e-7   floor (2Re-1)/|s0|^2 = 1.43643e-5
  B4 summatory function A(y) = sum_{n<=y} a_n :
     period sum = 0.0  (must be 0 for A to be bounded)
     closed form matches brute force for n<=20000: True
     sup_{y<=20000} |A(y)| = 1.284079044   (= 1+kappa = 1.284079044)
     ==> Psi_DH is BOUNDED and 5-periodic; Psi_DH^(1) is supported in (0,1] and in L^2. [HYPOTHESIS MET]
  B5 Mellin symbol of the transferred family, direct step-sum vs -alpha^s F(s)/s:
     alpha=1/1  s=(0.7 + 3.0j)  direct=(-0.0143642792552 + 0.437215167794j)  -alpha^s F/s=(-0.014364279556 + 0.43721516723j)  |diff|=6.39e-10
     alpha=1/2  s=(0.65 + 9.0j)  direct=(-0.0090666508943 + 0.0186157516775j)  -alpha^s F/s=(-0.00906664972341 + 0.0186157517961j)  |diff|=1.18e-9
     alpha=1/3  s=(0.85 + 2.0j)  direct=(0.216990402213 - 0.0342199954377j)  -alpha^s F/s=(0.216990402103 - 0.0342199955346j)  |diff|=1.47e-10

